# CNPY-2140 Angular 14 -> 15 / Material 15 MDC deprecation log (northgate-canopy-ui, Canopy 3.7.2 -> 4.0.0)
# Source: 01-ng-update/ng-update-core-cli.log, 01-ng-update/ng-update-material.log, build.log, build-showcase.log,
#         test.log, npm-ci.log, npm-audit.json, scanner-xray-violations.txt in this directory; REPORT.md sections 3, 5-8.
#
# ng update @angular/core@15 @angular/cli@15 @angular-eslint/schematics@15 migrations applied:
#   - @angular-eslint/schematics "Updates @angular-eslint to v15"
#       -> .eslintrc.json (root + projects/canopy-showcase): 2 files modified; @angular-eslint/* re-pinned exact 15.2.1
#          (save-exact=true, floating versions are forbidden)
#   - @angular/cli "Remove Browserslist configuration files that match the CLI default"
#       -> projects/canopy-showcase/.browserslistrc deleted (CLI 15 default is identical)
#   - @angular/cli "Remove no longer needed require calls in Karma builder main file"
#       -> projects/canopy-ui/src/test.ts, projects/canopy-showcase/src/test.ts: `require.context` spec discovery removed;
#          specs are discovered from `include` in angular.json ("**/*.spec.ts", "lib/**/*.ts" so coverage counts every
#          library source file, CNPY-1402)
#   - @angular/cli "Update TypeScript compiler `target` and set `useDefineForClassFields`"
#       -> tsconfig.json: target ES2022, useDefineForClassFields: false
#   - @angular/cli "Remove exported `@angular/platform-server` `renderModule`" -> no change (no SSR)
#   - @angular/cli "Remove options from 'angular.json' that are no longer supported by the official builders" -> no change
#   - @angular/core "relativeLinkResolution removed from Router config" -> no change (no usages)
#   - @angular/core "RouterLinkWithHref -> RouterLink" -> no change (no usages)
#
# ng update @angular/material@15 (after removing @angular/flex-layout; two earlier runs refused on its `@angular/cdk ^14` peer):
#   - @angular/cdk "Updates the Angular CDK to v15" -> no change
#   - @angular/material "Updates the Angular Material to v15" -> 51 files modified: every Mat*Module import rewritten to
#     MatLegacy*Module and every mat.*-theme mixin to mat.legacy-*. REVERTED by hand for every component except the two
#     below; the MDC modules and Material 15 theming/density APIs were restored in commit ff7c469 (REPORT.md section 3).
#
# Deprecated in the Canopy 4.0.0 public API (marked @deprecated in source, listed in CHANGELOG.md "Deprecated"):
#   - cn-amount-slider: CnAmountSliderComponent, CnAmountSliderModule (projects/canopy-ui/src/lib/forms/amount-slider)
#       -> still renders the Material 15 LEGACY (pre-MDC) mat-slider via MatLegacySliderModule; mat.legacy-slider-theme /
#          -color are included from themes/_theme.scss (_legacy-component-themes). The MDC mat-slider removes thumbLabel,
#          displayWith and tickInterval, which the amount-slider design relies on.
#          BLOCKED - awaiting human design decision KAN-27 (Highest, parent KAN-23). Not decided in this hop.
#          HARD DEADLINE: @angular/material/legacy-slider is DELETED in Material 16. KAN-27 must be implemented before
#          the Canopy 15 -> 16 hop can start.
#   - cn-filter-chips: CnFilterChipsComponent, CnFilterChipsModule (projects/canopy-ui/src/lib/data-display/filter-chips)
#       -> still renders the Material 15 LEGACY mat-chip-list via MatLegacyChipsModule; mat.legacy-chips-theme / -color
#          included from themes/_theme.scss. MDC mat-chip-listbox / mat-chip-grid selection semantics differ from the
#          3.x mat-chip-list selection model; the owner must define the new behaviour.
#          BLOCKED - awaiting human decision KAN-28 (Highest, parent KAN-23). Not decided in this hop.
#          HARD DEADLINE: @angular/material/legacy-chips is DELETED in Material 16; same constraint as KAN-27.
#   - Both components keep their 3.7.2 DOM (.mat-slider-*, .mat-chip-*), so their showcase pages render pixel-identical
#     (showcase-visual/SUMMARY.md). Their stylesheets are 2 of the 3 files with active .mat-* selectors (REPORT.md s7).
#     ADR-0002 secondary entry points were considered and not used: moving them would be a second import-path break in
#     the same major (REPORT.md section 6).
#
# Removed from the public surface in this hop (BREAKING, CHANGELOG.md 4.0.0):
#   - @angular/flex-layout peer dependency (14.0.0-beta.41): EOL at Angular 15, CDK peer ^14 blocked the Material update.
#     cn-page-header / cn-page-shell use CSS flex/grid; removed from the showcase too. Consumers using fxLayout* in their
#     own templates must self-install or replace it (docs/MIGRATION-4.0.md section 2).
#   - Material 2014 typography level names in $cn-typography / $cn-typography-dense / canopy.theme($typography):
#     $display-4..1, $headline, $title, $subheading-2, $subheading-1 renamed to the Material 15 names; $input REMOVED with
#     no replacement (MDC form fields take the body level). Rewritten in consumer stylesheets by the ng update migration
#     canopy-4-theme-mixin (projects/canopy-ui/schematics/migrations.json).
#     The $body-2 / $subheading-1 rows of the table are Canopy's metric-preserving mapping, not Material's
#     private-typography-to-2018-config table: design decision KAN-33 (Highest, parent KAN-23), NOT decided here, the
#     implemented table is unchanged (REPORT.md s8 item 2 / s10 item 5, docs/MIGRATION-4.0.md section 3).
#   - Canopy's internal .mat-* overrides (ADR-0004 list: .mat-button-wrapper, .mat-form-field-underline, .mat-select-panel,
#     .mat-slide-toggle-bar, .mat-header-cell, .mat-tab-label, .mat-ink-bar, .mat-dialog-container, .mat-simple-snackbar,
#     .mat-tooltip, .mat-progress-bar-fill, .mat-checkbox-*/.mat-radio-* ripples): gone; consumer CSS / specs that matched
#     them no longer match (docs/MIGRATION-4.0.md section 5). Ledgerline's LDG-3104 patches target these names.
#   - NgxMaskModule import in cn-masked-input (ngx-mask 15 removed it): replaced by NgxMaskDirective + provideNgxMask().
#     No public API change.
#
# API notes recorded, not decided (REPORT.md section 10):
#   - CnDensity runtime type stays 'default' | 'compact' while the Sass API exposes $cn-density-dense (-2) and the theme
#     mixin emits .cn-density-dense; whether 'dense' joins the runtime type is an API decision for the design-system team.
#   - MDC form-field geometry / hint and floating-label colour, 18 px checkbox glyph, 56 px paginator: left at MDC
#     defaults pending design (substance of KAN-31).
#
# Deprecations outstanding after the hop (none block the build; build.log and build-showcase.log 0 warnings; 47/47 specs test.log):
